# What every defence to their 1NT shares (vs-1nt.bid): the answers to
# the two-suited calls, the penalty double, the preempts. Cappelletti
# (21GF-DEFAULT) makes the calls; the answers are the same for the others.
card    21GF-DEFAULT
dealer  E

# seat hand                 | auction              | expect | why
# Preempts: a seven-card suit too weak for the one-suited call
S QJ98632.K4.T2.J5          | 1NT                  | 3S     | seven spades, 7 HCP
# Both majors (Cappelletti 2♦)
N 954.K82.Q8743.J5          | 1NT 2D P             | 2H     | three of each: hearts
N Q954.82.Q873.J54          | 1NT 2D P             | 2S     | longer spades
N K954.A82.AQ73.54          | 1NT 2D P             | 4S     | four spades, 13 HCP: game
N 2.43.J52.KQJ8643          | 1NT 2D P             | 3C     | seven clubs, no major: to play
N 954.K82.Q8743.J5          | 1NT 2D X             | 2H     | their double changes nothing
# A major and a minor (Cappelletti 2♥)
N 95.K82.Q8743.J54          | 1NT 2H P             | P      | three hearts, 6 HCP: play 2♥
N 954.8.Q8743.KJ54          | 1NT 2H P             | 2NT    | a singleton heart: which minor?
N A54.K82.A843.954          | 1NT 2H P             | 3H     | three hearts, 11: invite
N A54.K82.AK43.954          | 1NT 2H P             | 4H     | three hearts, 14: game
N KQJ8643.2.J52.43          | 1NT 2H P             | 2S     | seven spades of my own
S Q5.AQT76.QJT3.QT          | 1NT 2H P 2NT P       | 3D     | my minor is diamonds
# Both minors (2NT)
N 954.K82.Q873.J54          | 1NT 2NT P            | 3D     | longer diamonds
N 954.K82.J54.Q873          | 1NT 2NT P            | 3C     | longer clubs
# The penalty double
N 954.K82.Q8743.J5          | 1NT X P              | P      | 6 HCP: sit
N J8764.82.743.J54          | 1NT X P              | 2S     | 2 HCP and five spades: run
